window.products.push({"id":541050,"name":"Appetizers Plates Oval Yellow by Cucina Italiana","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S+-QB9yCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"For a trendy departure from traditional dinnerware, serve your menu items on this stunning cucina Italiana ceramic divided appetizer rectangular serving platter. As the perfect size for pastries, sushi rolls, and other starters, this original cucina Italiana serving dish combines simplicity and style to help your establishment stand out from the rest!  Wherever you are serving relishes, whether in your home, restaurant, or bar, this ceramic Relish Dip Dish serving tray will prove to be a practical asset. Simply fill the four compartments with pickles, olives, salsa, cheese, fruit, or any other dip of choice, and grip the handles of the serving platter rattan holder basket to carry out to guests.  With a royal textured surface, our ceramic tray,dip tray is elegant in appearance, suitable for formal and casual settings alike. The clean-cut design is especially presentable. whether it be an outdoor picnic your patio, backyard, or dining room table. Allows guests to help themselves and eliminates the need for additional cutlery.  Although designed for relishes, this dish can also hold nuts, dried fruit, candies and more. It can even be used to serve fresh veggies and dips. Versatile and multipurpose, it can be used for any occasion. A pleasure to use, this serving tray is one you will take out time and time again and continue to use for one celebration after another.  Imagine a piece that is exquisitely elegant yet practical in purpose at the same time. This marriage of fashion and function is epitomized by the ceramic Relish Dish. Newlywed couples or anyone who entertains guests will appreciate the generous size of this dish that holds enough condiments to serve a crowd","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71S+-QB9yCL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"5th Ave Store","source_asin":"B0100JKS1Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-541050","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0100JKS1Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0100JKS1Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
