window.products.push({"id":541171,"name":"Glow in Dark Pokeball Wax Oil Silicone Jar Nonstick Herb Stash Container for Storage Sticky Concentrations,Pill,Lip Balm (Pokeball Jar-5pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81n+b5eDniL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★Auchee Premium Silicone Accessories are made with 100% high quality food grade silicone. ★The Glow in Dark Pokeball jar, super durable, keeps your wax fresh and has a safe closure. This kit is a perfect solution for handling sticky materials such as lip balm, spices, wax, painting, cream and anything you could think of.★Specification:6ml Pokeball Jar: Dia 38mmWeight: 23g/pc★What's included in the package?1 x Red+White Pokeball Jar (normal color).1 x Green Pokeball Jar (glow in dark).1 x Yellow Pokeball Jar (glow in dark).1 x Blue Pokeball Jar (glow in dark).1 x Blue+White Pokeball Jar (glow in dark).1 x Surprise Bonus Gift.★Attention: Glow in dark jars need absorbing light after unpack from packing box, then glow in dark can effect in night.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81n+b5eDniL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Auchee","source_asin":"B074CYFMF8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-541171","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074CYFMF8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074CYFMF8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":541172,"name":"Motorized Lower Nozzle Hose, 6\" x 1.25\" ID, 1 1/4\" Replacement Floor Lower Nozzle Hose Compatible for Shark Rocket HV302 HV300, Vacuum Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lJNLtda+L._AC_SL1384_.jpg","description":"Product description Color:1 Pack Pokin Replacement Floor Lower Nozzle Hose Compatible with Shark HV300, HV302, HV320, HV321, HV322 Rocket Vacuum Specification: 1.Flexible Extension Made of high-quality plastic material, flexible and durable, have a long service life. 2.Suction Lower Nozzle Hose Regularly replaces the lower duct hose which can help filter the dust and keep your house clean. Suggest to replace your shark Rocket duct hose 6-12 months, which can help maintain the suction and life of your vacuum. Step by Step Installation for HV301： 1. First of all, you will detach its base from the handle. 2. Remove underside screws so you can disassemble base unit cover. 3. Do not use long screws in these location as they will break the fittings. For that, you must have to note that where the three short screws go. 4. Then what you have to do is to separate the gray cover from base unit. 5. You will remove cleaning bottom cover from the base and unlock it. 6. So, to separate the hose from the fitting, you will cut the hose in half then you will pull it and twist it at the same time. There is another way you can lift the hose. You can use needle nose pliers and twisting action. 7. By pulling up and out at the same time, you can easily remove black socket hose from the base. 8. Must use grease for the exterior ends of the hose. You can also use oil. 9. So, the hardest step is here now, you will have to screw the new hose into black socket fitting. You will be putting little pressure on the hose and twisting it at the same time. So, you can get the hose started into the socket. Repeat this until the hose is fully inserted into the socket. 10. Now you will be inserting the hose into other fitting, you will find","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lJNLtda+L._AC_SL1384_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aoheke","source_asin":"B09C5FPRVL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-541172","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C5FPRVL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C5FPRVL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
