window.products.push({"id":541177,"name":"GLOW4U Floral Palm Leaf Pattern Self Adhesive Contact Paper Shelf Drawer Liner Removable Wallpaper for Cabinets Shelves Drawer Wall Arts and Crafts De","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xFbLmyIeL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"This decorative contact paper shelf drawer liner is a quick and economical solution to modernize furniture accessories and appliances in your home.  PLEASE NOTED: If you purchase two items or more, we will package all items together in ONE continuous roll. Buy enough rolls at a time to make sure they come from the same batch to avoid color difference.  Instruction For Use: 1. It can be placed on any smooth clean and dry surface like shelf, drawer, dresser ,cabinet,walls,window,glass and so on. It is best applied at room temperature. 2. Sand down rough surfaces prior to sticking. Clean large surfaces with mild soap and water. 3. Measure the surface to cover. Cut the film into right size, leaving about 5cm extra overlap on all edges is beter. 4. Peel off the backing paper evenly with one hand whilst smoothing the film to the surface. With your other hand, from the center to edges. For this it's better to use a soft cloth. 5. Creases and air bubbles can be removed by applying light pressure from the center to the edges. Pierce stubborn bubbles with a needle and squeeze the air out.   Note: 1.Color tones can vary due to lighting in the room, pictures on wall for reference only. 2.Buy enough rolls at a time to make sure they come from the same batch to avoid color difference. 3. Wallpaper you will receive may have some wrinkles on it or both ends, but it do not effect looking after use on dry flat surface. Hope you can understand","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xFbLmyIeL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GLOW4U","source_asin":"B07857BMNG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-541177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07857BMNG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07857BMNG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":541178,"name":"CANRAY Shower Curtain Rod Holders for Wall | Adhesive Shower Tension Rod Mount brackets | No Drilling | Stick On | 2 Pack, White (Shower Curtain Rod N","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-kzoxxcwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There are always unpleasant incidents in our lives that disturb us. When we are soaking in the bath and enjoying the nice time. Suddenly, the bar of the shower curtain falls down, breaking the tub and even hurting us. Then the happy time is over, and we have to clean up the mess.When it comes the midnight, we are playing with our children in a beautiful dream. Suddenly \"bang\", the sound scares the sleepy kids to cry. It turns out that the shower curtain rod falling in the bathroom, which has interrupted our complete sleep. Investigations found that the elasticity of most shower curtain rod will weaken after a period of use, and the lack of grip will eventually cause them to fall off. This will cause great troubles to our life, may damage the bathtub tiles, and even hurt our family members. CANRAY shower rod holder, such a simple solution to an annoying problem! We focus on providing customers with competitive products, care for our better life and improve our life quality. Item features： √ Simple and elegant design concept - suitable for a variety of Bathroom Styles. √ High quality acrylic material and high strength 3M adhesive. √ Multiple mounting options - whether need screws depends on whether your walls are flat or not. Item include： 2 set of shower curtain rod holder 2 set of expansion screws ▶We offer lifetime free return,24 hours customer support,please no hesitate to add to cart right now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-kzoxxcwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CANRAY","source_asin":"B09D3GKG62","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-541178","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09D3GKG62","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09D3GKG62","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
