window.products.push({"id":541184,"name":"Engel-Riviere All-Ply Copper Core Signature Dolphin Wok","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C4kn-5GcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Feng shui is about how to balance the energies of a given space or area to assure health and good fortune to those living in it. The All-Ply signature dolphin wok with its functionality and simplicity was designed with that in mind as the double carp symbol in Feng shui represents joyous unions, a happy marriage, good fortune, prosperity, success and is usually kept where family members dine together. By having this lovely wok in your kitchen it will not only create positive energy (Chi) and a pleasant cooking exosphere but will protect you as well. Compatible with all cooktops including Induction. This durable, warp resistant, oven proof (up to 600℉), dishwasher safe All-Ply cookware maximizes contact between the heat source and the food. Designed to respond to the demands of the most experienced chefs, it also provides the consistency of heating to help the novice cook produce great results every time. All-Ply cookware is NSF, UL and CE approved for commercial use and every piece of All-Ply cookware features a unique and serialized number after being hand inspected by Chief Designer Antonio Engel to ensure each piece of All-Ply cookware you receive is perfect. The ergonomic and comfortably designed stay cool handles are double stainless steel riveted an industry first for sturdy longevity and ease of cleaning. The upper edge of the cookware has a specially designed rim to eliminate unwanted spillage and make pouring liquids a breeze along with a unique polished exterior your stainless steel cookware prevents tarnishing and discoloration. With proper use and care, your All-Ply cookware will offer you a lifetime of satisfaction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71C4kn-5GcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Engel-Riviere","source_asin":"B00ZCGY544","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-541184","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZCGY544","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZCGY544","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
