window.products.push({"id":541274,"name":"SLENPET 10000mAh Rechargeable Battery Operated Fan, Portable USB Port Power Supply, Timer Off Quiet Desk Fan, 200 Hours Working Time, 350°Rotation Tab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BmBuEMq-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Long Working Time & Sleep Timer - Build-in 10000mAh battery, supports a maximum of 40 hours working time. Sleep timers will automatically switch off the fan when your preset limit time up, which can save more power for longer working. 2A fast charging with Micro-USB and USB-C charging ports, you can charge the fan by USB charger, power bank, car charger, computer, laptop, etc. Strong and Robust Clip - The tough clamps allow you to clip the fan on any surface easily. The clip fan has a sturdier construction with thicker ABS & PP plastic, not worried about it wearing out over time. The desk fan has a hook under the base, you also can hang the fan on the other object. The powerful spring grip on the bottom makes it easy to attach to the stroller, desk, bed, tent, treadmill, car seat, etc. Apply to home, office, camping, travel, courtyard, seaside, etc. Powerful Motor & Low Noise - What the clip fan can do is to keep your cool and calm in the hot summer. The upgraded motor, stronger power and lower noise. High, mid, low 3 speed setting + 1 energy saving setting, meet your different needs. The low noise ensures the fan won't disturb your working and your kid's sleeping. You can run the fan while it's charging, when the fan is charging, the indicator light flashes red, and after fully charged, the indicator light is solid red. 7 Inch Blades & Strong Airflow - The larger blades, the stronger airflow. The clip fan added with clamps and pivots that enable 360 Degree rotation. 360° rotation allows the fan to provide omnidirectional adjustable airflow, aim airflow exactly where you need it, ensures you always can enjoy the cooling wind in the right position, covers an extended area. The fan circulates the air by moving an incredible amount of air, calm you down, building cooling and comfortable conditions for you. Safe Design - The battery type of fan is Lithium Polymer. As a new upgraded battery type, the Lithium Polymer battery has many obvious advantages compared with the other Lithium-Ion batteries, such as high energy density, miniaturization, and high safety. Efficient battery output capability makes the fan works stably, not easy to be hot even after a long time working. There is a nonslip pad under the base, so that the fan won't slide easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71BmBuEMq-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SLENPET","source_asin":"B089QBPQ9P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-541274","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089QBPQ9P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089QBPQ9P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
