window.products.push({"id":541368,"name":"Aynaxcol 4 Blades Heat Powered Stove Fan Wood Burning Stove Fireplace Fan for Heated Air Eco Stove Fan Wood Log Burner Fireplace Silent Operation(Silv","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":41.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vNZyeh8gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Eco Friendly, No Batteries or Electricity required- The stove fan is powered by heat from your fireplace or wood burning stove. Adjust its speed automatically with the stove surface temperature. The hotter the stove is, the faster the stove fan spins. Good wood stove fireplace fan- The stove fan will help reduce the fuel consumption and make the room warmer quickly, the stove fan is widely used for gas, electric, pellet stove or wood burning stove, stove fans will work well and disperse hot air efficiently. Silent Operation- The only moving part of the stove fan is the blades assembly, so the working noise is below 25DB, very quiet. You can't feel the stove fan, but you will feel the warm. Overheating Protection & Longer lifetime-There is a Bi-metallic safety device in the base of the stove fan.If the surface temperature rises above around 300℃, the safety device gently elevates the front of the fan to protect the motor. Working Temperature- The general working temperature of the stove fan is 85°C - 350°C(185°F - 660°F). Usually the fan gets spinning at about 55°C, and turns most efficiently when the temperature reaches about 250°C-300°C.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vNZyeh8gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Aynaxcol","source_asin":"B08P7F4S8T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-541368","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P7F4S8T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P7F4S8T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":541369,"name":"Ergo Elements Manual Height Adjustable Stand Up Desk Frame Crank System Ergonomic Standing 2 Leg Workstation, Grey","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41C5PSi28pL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"The adjustable height standing desk manual hand-crank base by Ergo Elements. Ergo Elements creates active office equipment to match active lifestyles. The manual hand crank model of the Ergo Elements adjustable height standing desk allows for users without access to power to work in the healthy and production standing position. The hand-crank model is cordless, so it eliminates all headaches caused by handing and/or tangled cords. Physical mobility has been notably linked to problem solving and increased brain function for some time. The corporate world fits teams into tiny desks and expects innovative results to Drive business forward. All the while, our bodies need movement for our Brains to move forward. Sitting down all day is killing us. As grown adults who work long hours, Ergo Elements has taken our health and wellness into our own hands by creating a product line that helps us work and live better. The Ergo Elements adjustable height standing desk base can adjust both it's length and height. The length adjustment is done once, during setup, and the height adjustment can be made over and over again with the use of the simple hand crank. The bases length can be adjusted (during setup) from 40\" (min length) all the way to 66\" (max length). the base's height can be adjusted (via the hand crank) from 27\" (min height) all the way up to 45\" (max height). the frame width is a fixed 24. 5\". this powerless adjustable height desk base comes with the manual Dual-Action removable hand crank. Ergo Elements has the best customer service in the industry. Have an issue with your product speak directly to one of our knowledgeable and available customer service reps. Take advantage of our easy-to-use assembly instructions and Library of product assembly videos. Ergo Elements is the clear choice for adjustable height standing desks and all active office equipment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41C5PSi28pL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ergo Elements","source_asin":"B00ZK8FUP2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-541369","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00ZK8FUP2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00ZK8FUP2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
