window.products.push({"id":541470,"name":"Clothes Hangers Space Saving 4 Packs Hanger Organizer Magic Space Saver Hangers Sturdy Plastic Cascading Hangers Smart Closet Organization for Home, C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Rpzv81PSL._AC_.jpg","description":"Discover Clothing Organizational Solutions for Your Home ! If you're tired of seeing disorderly clothes everywhere in your wardrobe then you need a high-quality hanger organizer to keep your closet neated.lets you easily increase the storage volume of your closet by letting you hang up to 9 garments vertically from the same closet rod. It provides excellent functions especially suitable for closet wardrobe of small storage room, compact apartments, and college dorms, RV or holiday home Durable--Complaried with metal hangers, our plasctic hangers won't to be rust.Thickened our material, for preventing broken and long lasting use.Each folding hanger is durably designed to accommodate up to 30 lbs. Space Saving -The closet hangers can be hung vertically or horizontally to maximize closet space.Perfect for coat closet, seasonal clothing or your entire closet with these sturdy space saver products. Convenient Design - 360°rotation, easy to take off your clothes quickly.Every hanger organizer can hold 9 pcs clothes. Easy to install-Simple Installation beyond imagination.Just take out the hook and install it to the products. Size - Approx.13.2 x 2 x 0.9 inch (L x W x H). Hook diameter: Approx.3.1 Inch. Package ---4 x hangers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Rpzv81PSL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sikravul","source_asin":"B07X1S6Y98","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-541470","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07X1S6Y98","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07X1S6Y98","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":541471,"name":"SUPERIOR 100% Cotton Luxury Beach Towels - Oversized Beach Towel, 450 GSM Swim Towel, Multicolor Oceana Stripes (34\" x 64\")","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.67,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LtyhpF2oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Affordable Luxury Linens This towel is essential for summer fun at the beach or in the backyard. Made of thick cotton, this thirsty beach towel dries quickly without fading. It reverses from a soft velour side to an absorbent loop terry side, keeping you warm and dry. Our extra large beach towels are available in a wide variety of fun styles and bright colors from nautical and patriotic designs perfect for a Fourth of July pool party, to cute creature beach towels for girls and boys, and classic stripes and polka dots, an easy choice for all beachgoers.  These beach towels, oversized at 34\" x 64\", are great for adults and kids, and can even be used as a beach blanket or beach chair cover. Our luxurious jacquard construction means that these towels are not printed, so they're much softer than a screenprinted towel, and they will not fade in the wash. Superior's oversize beach towels will soon become your family's favorite, and will last for years to come. Heritage We have been manufacturing fine linens for over 40 years. We make everything from towels and bath robes, to comforters and mattress toppers, sheets, duvets, pillowcases, and bedskirts, and even area rugs. Our wide range of colors, patterns, and price points ensures that every one of our customers will be able to find something they'll love. We are experts in manufacturing high quality textiles and pride ourselves on only producing the finest products. See what our customers have to say: \"These are the greatest towels, large and thick!\" \"Thick enough, but not too thick; it could fold up and fit into a standard sized beach tote bag without filling the entire space\" \"Aaahhhhh another lovely towel with a beautiful design and vibrant colors. I love this one and the extra size is great. Perfect for the beach and the pool. Soft and cuddly\" \"Absolutely gorgeous towel! Excellent quality! It's kitten soft on the \"Velour\" side and standard terry cloth on the terry side. And it's BIG! I was concerned that the velour side would not be very absorbent but no - it sucks up water like a sponge and feels silky smooth on your skin! I was so pleased I ordered a 2nd one!\" \"this is a huge, wraparound, fairly heavy looped terry cloth towel work of art. recommend. 10 stars\" And try them for yourself!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91LtyhpF2oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUPERIOR","source_asin":"B074F3DR1N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-541471","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074F3DR1N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074F3DR1N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
