window.products.push({"id":541491,"name":"Perfect Pampas Natural Pampas Grass, 3 Stems of 44-48\" Tall, Large & Fluffy, Boho Decor Wedding, No Shedding No Stench, Dried Flowers Bouquet Arrangem","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tG9Evty3L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"Pampas Grass is known for being an decoration. Pompous grass has the elegance of a real flower but can be kept year-round. Our Pampas Grass Branches are soft and are not easily broken. These faux grass may be used to complement any homes interior, exterior design, or boho decor. It can be placed in a flowerpot or be attached to a wall. Our pampas grass is perfect for indoor and outdoor decoration, creating a boho look or simple decorations for living room, office, hotel room, home bar, restaurant, wedding ceremony... Whether its home decorations for the living room or wall dcor for the living room, we use our expertise to make sure each product is fresh and beautiful.We use high-quality packaging materials to protect pampas grass stems in the box during shipping. We pick up and handle the best pampas grass to satisfied our customers. If you have any questions or problems about our products, we are ready to help you. Simply contact Perfect Pampas directly via Messaging and we will make it right for you!??How to make your Pampas Fluffy and Perfect?Pampas can become squashed in transit however this is normal. To obtain the best look at the pampas please follow the following instructions:Shake off pampas, preferably outside or on the balcony. Please put it in the vase, but dont add water.When the flowers are placed in the sun, the plumage can quickly return to a full and natural state. You can use a hairdryer alsoIf you dont want the plumage of the bouquet to fall, you can spray it with transparent spray or hair gel to make it fluffy and fashionable.Place it in a beautiful glass jar or vase for creating a mystic and moody escape.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51tG9Evty3L._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PP Perfect Pampas","source_asin":"B09B4HCGVM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-541491","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B4HCGVM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B4HCGVM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
