window.products.push({"id":541665,"name":"Polkar Silicone Pastry Mat BPA Free,Extra Thick Non Stick Baking Mat with Measurement, Counter Mat, Dough Rolling Mat. (silicone pastry mat)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DHU8Fql+L._AC_.jpg","description":"Color:23.6 X15.7inches Red Key Features 1. Our specially designed silicone pastry mat measures 23.6 X15.7inches,the pastry mat is outlined with inch and centimeter ruled guides, you can use recipes from all over the world and not worry about unit conversions.  2. It has 5in to 12 in diameter circular makings for crafting pies,tortillas,ect.  3. food grade silicone ,and is effective from temperatures of -40 degrees F (-40C) to 450 degrees F(230C)  4. Silicone pasty mat is very easy to clean, with warm water and soap,can also be placed in the dishwasherm,and let air dry ,best stored flat or rolled up.   5. Ideal for kneading,rolling,and shaping breads,pizza dough’s,pastas,pastries,pie crusts and fondants.Provides a clean extra large baking or cooking preparation surface,makes the perfect gift. Why choose the Silicone Baking Mat? *100% food grade silicone,no chemical odors, for safe; *Heat safe baking mat can be used in the oven or microwave as a liner for your cookware. *Nonstick surface lets you skip greasing! *Design includes weight, temperature & metric conversions. Your satisfaction is guaranteed. Click the \"Add to Cart\" button to Order Now for a truly enjoyable baking experience. Package Included: 1 X Silicone Pastry Mat","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51DHU8Fql+L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"polkar","source_asin":"B01HHU7WMY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-541665","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01HHU7WMY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01HHU7WMY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":541666,"name":"Kindream 3L Cool Mist Humidifier, High Mist Volume, Humidifier for Bedroom with Night Lights, Touch Button, Quiet, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xo2Ky+DfL._AC_.jpg","description":"KINDREAM COOL MIST HUMIDIFIER (0.79 GALLON) & TIMER STOP FEATURE: This humidifier instantly and safely hydrates dry air, creating a comfortable and breathable atmosphere that will free you from dry nose, dry throat, cough and other cold-like symptoms . System automatic shutdown function: The product circuit program is set to automatically shut down after 8 hours and 16 hours. SMART HUMIDIFIERS FOR BEDROOM ULTRA-QUIET&NIGHT LIGHT MODE: The professional sleep mode ensures a sound sleep all night with the humidifier's near-silent operation and display off function. Three adjustable haze levels allow you to have the most comfortable environment.The vaporizers for bedroom with Night light mode allows you and your child to sleep soundly and never be afraid of the dark again. Dual nozzle design FOUR MODES TO SWITCH: 1. Press and hold for three seconds to turn on the night light mode, and press again for three seconds to turn off the night light. 2. Press the button to start continuous spray mode (two sprinklers run together); 3. Press the button a second time to start alternate spray mode (single sprinkler operation); 4. Press the third button to start intermittent spray mode (two sprinklers) The nozzles run together, spray for three seconds, stop for three seconds). EASY CLEANING AND TOP FILL: The top fill design with removable components makes the evaporator easier to clean. (Important note: The top triangular scale should match the outer casing triangular scale, press firmly for three seconds until the humidifier operates normally after the night light flashes.) The top is hollowed out, and water can be added directly without opening the evaporator, which is convenient and simple. SERVICES & TIPS:The triangle on the humidifier top cover needs to line up with the triangle on the housing, and the air humidifiers can only be used after the light is on.The humidifiers for baby comes with 80cm data cable.We provide you with a one-year warranty, and our customer service team will answer your mission concerns within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xo2Ky+DfL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"kindream","source_asin":"B09QFNNDXM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-541666","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QFNNDXM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QFNNDXM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
