window.products.push({"id":541854,"name":"Fadoryou Automatic Soap Dispenser Touchless, 11oz/ 320ml Automatic Foaming Soap Dispenser Rechargeable, Automatic Hand Soap Dispenser, Adjustable, Wat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LmMIjiUgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Touch Free & 0.2s Quick Foaming】 Fadoryou automatic soap dispenser touchless adopts the precise infrared motion and PIR sensor detection technology, which give you hands free dense foam soap consistently and quickly within 0.2s. No touch, no need to pump, more health and convenient! Moreover, this automatic soap dispenser makes washing hands a more interesting thing for kids! Great for kids! 【Works With Any Soap】 This automatic foaming soap dispenser works with whichever your favorite liquid hand soap or foam soap (except for gel hand santinizer). FOAM SOAP is recommended for better performance. For LIQUID SOAP, please DILUTE it with water at the ratio of 1:3 to start before using, and this will help you save more than 50% soap. 320ml / 11oz reservoir lasts up to 500 hand washes. Money saving and long lasting time! 【3 Adjustable Volume Levels, Touch Button & LED Display】 This automatic hand soap dispenser has 3 volume levels, and is designed with touch switch button and unique LED digital display. You can clearly check temperature (℃/℉) and battery capacity from this LED display even at night. Long touch the top button to turn on / off item. After turned on it, simple touch to switch temperature between ℃ and ℉; double touch quickly to adjust volume levels (1s/ 1.5s/ 2s 's foaming). Easy to operate! 【Automatic Soap Dispenser Rechargeble】 Built-in 1500 capacity rechargeable battery and with fast charging. No need to replace batteries any more! More convenient to use! When in low battery status, the last grid light on the LED display flashes which reminds you to charge it. When fully charged, all the three grid lights keeps on. 【Powerful & Quiet Pump】 Our automatic foam soap dispenser is equiped with upgraded pump, powerful but quiet without loud noise. No need to worry that it will disturb your family even at night. Simple morden style design, easily integrated into any places such as kitchen, bathroom, hospital, hotel, clinic, dispensary, office, etc. 【What You Get】 1x Fadoryou hands free soap dispenser; 1x charging cable; 1x user manual; 1 year worry-free after-sales support; friendly and easy to reach customer service. If you have any problems or issues, please just feel free to contact us!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LmMIjiUgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fadoryou","source_asin":"B09C2LNT1D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-541854","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09C2LNT1D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09C2LNT1D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
