window.products.push({"id":541875,"name":"WHW Whole House Worlds Artisinal Bark Rimmed Wooden Bowls, Set of 2, Made by Hand, Rustic Mango and Ash, Decorative, Natural Grain and Knot Details, O","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XCmEurUBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create amazing centerpiece bowls with always stylish bark rimmed wooden bowls. Loaded with sophisticated country style charm, these fine pieces are perfect to add a warm and welcoming accent to counter-tops, console table tops and dining room buffets Handcarved of both mango and ash woods, this set of bowls celebrate natural materials and are ideal to showcase table top displays during every season. As they are made of wood, expect individual and unique wood grain, bark and knotty details. No two trays are exactly alike. Each bowl in this set is sized incrementally, being longer than they are wide . They measure as follows: 1- 15 L x 11.75 W x 2.25 H, and 2 - 11 L x 7.75 W x 2 H inches. Bring the outdoors in and add a standout, nature-inspired element to your table, dresser top or mantel. Easy to care for, simply wash in warm water and towel dry. Oil as needed to maintain the natural surface. (Do not put in dishwasher) Welcome to the product line of Whole House Worlds. The New York based company offers high quality, stylish products for every room in the house, and beyond. From the kitchen, to the living room, to the bedroom, dining room, home office, closet and garden: Our criteria are comfort, quality, style and value.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71XCmEurUBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WHW Whole House Worlds","source_asin":"B07V9S52BM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-541875","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V9S52BM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V9S52BM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
